# A cost increase changes what a spell costs, never its mana value (CR 202.3; Thalia's ruling). Under Bot1's Thalia,
# Guardian of Thraben, Bot1's Lightning Bolt costs {1}{R} but is mana value 1, so Bot2's Spell Snare ("counter target spell
# with mana value 2") may not target it; Bot1's Mind Stone costs {3} and is mana value 2, and Spell Snare - itself {1}{U}
# under Thalia - counters it.

